msgid "Masonry library"
msgstr "Masonry 程式庫"

msgid "The library is properly installed."
msgstr "已適當地安裝程式庫。"

msgid "File found at %file"
msgstr "在 %f 檔中找到檔案"

msgid "Masonry not found"
msgstr "找不到 Masonry"

msgid "The library is missing. Please check that %file exists"
msgstr "遺漏此程式庫。 請檢查 %f 檔是否存在"

msgid "ImagesLoaded library"
msgstr "ImagesLoaded 程式庫"

msgid "ImagesLoaded not found"
msgstr "找不到 ImagesLoaded"

msgid "Masonry API"
msgstr "Masonry API"

msgid "Provides an API for integrating the jQuery Masonry plugin with Drupal."
msgstr "提供用於將 jQuery Masonry 外掛程式與 Drupal 整合的 API。"

msgid "Masonry"
msgstr "Masonry"

msgid "Column width"
msgstr "欄寬"

msgid ""
"The width of columns in the layout. Can be : <br/>\n"
" - empty: column will be the size of the first item found <br/>\n"
" - a size in pixel (ex. <em>10px</em>) <br/>\n"
" - a size in percentage (ex. <em>10%</em>) <br/>\n"
" - a CSS selector (ex. <em>#column-size</em>) <br/>\n"
" See the <a href=\"http://masonry.desandro.com/options.html#columnwidth\">masonry doc</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"佈置中的直欄寬度。 可以是：<br/>\n"
" - 空白：直欄將是找到的第一個項目的大小 <br/>\n"
" - 以像素為單位的大小（例如 <em>10px</em>）<br/>\n"
" - 以百分比表示的大小（例如 <em>10%</em>）<br/>\n"
" - CSS 選取器（例如 <em>#column-size</em>）<br/>\n"
" 如需相關資訊，請參閱 <a href=\"http://masonry.desandro.com/options.html#columnwidth\">Masonry 文件</a>。"

msgid "ex: 500px | 30% | .grid-sizer"
msgstr "例如：500px | 30% | .grid-sizer"

msgid "Gutter width"
msgstr "間距寬度"

msgid ""
"The spacing between each column. Can be : <br/>\n"
" - empty: no gutter<br/>\n"
" - a size in pixel (ex. <em>10px</em>) <br/>\n"
" - a size in percentage (ex. <em>10%</em>) <br/>\n"
" - a CSS selector (ex. <em>#column-size</em>) <br/>\n"
" See the <a href=\"http://masonry.desandro.com/options.html#gutter\">masonry doc</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"每個直欄之間的間距。 可以是：<br/>\n"
" - 空白：無裝訂線<br/>\n"
" - 以像素為單位的大小（例如 <em>10px</em>）<br/>\n"
" - 以百分比表示的大小（例如 <em>10%</em>）<br/>\n"
" - CSS 選取器（例如 <em>#column-size</em>）<br/>\n"
" 如需相關資訊，請參閱 <a href=\"http://masonry.desandro.com/options.html#gutter\">Masonry 文件</a>。"

msgid "ex: 10px | 2% | .gutter-sizer"
msgstr "例如：10px | 2% | .gutter-sizer"

msgid "Stamp Selector"
msgstr "戳記選取器"

msgid "Specifies which elements are stamped within the layout using css selector. <br/> See the <a href='http://masonry.desandro.com/options.html#stamp'>masonry doc</a> for more information."
msgstr "使用 css 選取器指定在佈置內戳記的元素。 <br/>如需相關資訊，請參閱 <a href='http://masonry.desandro.com/options.html#stamp'>Masonry 文件</a>。"

msgid "ex: .stamp-item"
msgstr "例如：.stamp-item"

msgid "Resizable"
msgstr "可調整大小"

msgid "Automatically rearrange items when the container is resized."
msgstr "調整儲存器大小時自動重新排列項目。"

msgid "Animated"
msgstr "動畫"

msgid "Animate item rearrangements."
msgstr "以動畫展示項目重新排列。"

msgid "Animation duration"
msgstr "動畫持續時間"

msgid "The duration of animations (1000 ms = 1 sec)."
msgstr "動畫的持續時間（1000 毫秒 = 1 秒）。"

msgid "ms"
msgstr "毫秒"

msgid "Fit width"
msgstr "最適寬度"

msgid "Sets the width of the container to the nearest column. Ideal for centering Masonry layouts. <br/> See the <a href='http://masonry.desandro.com/options.html#fitwidth'>masonry doc</a> for more information."
msgstr "將儲存器寬度設為最接近的直欄。 最適合置中 Masonry 佈置。 <br/>如需相關資訊，請參閱 <a href='http://masonry.desandro.com/options.html#fitwidth'>Masonry 文件</a>。"

msgid "Load images first"
msgstr "先載入影像"

msgid "Load all images first before triggering Masonry."
msgstr "先載入所有影像，然後再觸發 Masonry。"

msgid "Add listener for lazy loaded images."
msgstr "新增接聽器以接聽延遲載入的影像。"

msgid "If using the lazysizes library, you should probably activate this option."
msgstr "如果使用 lazysizes 程式庫，您可能應該啟動此選項。"

msgid "Force item width to the size of a column."
msgstr "將項目寬度強制設為直欄的大小。"

msgid "Sets items width to the size of column width. (/! Only works if the columnWidth size is defined to a value rather than a CSS selector)"
msgstr "將項目寬度設為欄寬的大小。（/! 僅當 columnWidth 大小定義為值而不是 CSS 選取器時才有效）"

msgid "Force percent position in layout"
msgstr "強制佈置中的百分比位置"

msgid "Sets item positions in percent values, rather than pixel values. Checking this will works well with percent-width items, as items will not transition their position on resize. <br/> See the <a href='http://masonry.desandro.com/options.html#percentposition'>masonry doc</a> for more information."
msgstr "以百分比值（而非像素值）設定項目位置。 勾選此設定將適合以百分比設定寬度的項目，因這些項目在調整大小時不會轉變其位置。 <br/>如需相關資訊，請參閱 <a href='http://masonry.desandro.com/options.html#percentposition'>Masonry 文件</a>。"

msgid "The unit seems to be missing on this field."
msgstr "此欄位似乎遺漏裝置。"

